{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方最大号的主标题“回去未必找回亲近，他仍想：万一能呢?”首先吸引视线；随后紫色大字“他不愿只凭指望回去忍让”因颜色突出进入视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个想回去、但知道回去未必能恢复亲近的人。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"仍抱希望、犹豫、不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"更具体的顾虑是怕独自承担、心里没底；以及先把眼下过稳、却不收回原有打算的应对态度。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题、紫色大句和下面的灰色大句字号接近，形成多个显眼的文字入口，争夺后续注意力。\",\n    \"后两块大字分别补充不愿忍让的态度和内心顾虑，需要再看才能理解完整。\",\n    \"下方小字连续排列多个短语，需要在不同信息之间挑选。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a9373e33-9aa0-4d52-b8b4-4bd5f886b7db", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T024021455423Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:40:48.067806+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7f38fb208d3cab323b9177a78aab3b3217be60a5682494a84a9819b681f758c8", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3